        "parent_text_tail": [
          "Both probes are spawned and running in the background:\n\n- **Version-pinning probe** \u2014 `sthr_01EQrvGxScSXh2b5keJAdGm3`\n- **Tool-grant probe** \u2014 `sthr_01CCuU6iEdw8L578QL9hcZAw`\n\nI'll report both replies verbatim and emit the JSON summary block once their results arrive.",
          "Received the version-pinning probe's reply. Still waiting on the tool-grant probe (`sthr_01CCuU6iEdw8L578QL9hcZAw`) before I can complete the report.",
